WEBVTT

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.393
When minorities are undercounted,

00:05:00.417 --> 00:05:03.393
AI models supporting
public transportation,

00:05:03.417 --> 00:05:04.851
housing, health care,

00:05:04.875 --> 00:05:06.143
insurance

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:11.559
are likely to overlook the communities
that require these services the most.

00:05:11.583 --> 00:05:13.768
First step to improving results

00:05:13.792 --> 00:05:16.184
is to make that database representative

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:19.476
of age, gender, ethnicity and race

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:20.792
per census data.

00:05:21.792 --> 00:05:23.434
Since census is so important,

00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:27.559
we have to make every effort
to count 100 percent.

00:05:27.583 --> 00:05:31.643
Investing in this data
quality and accuracy